[Ip]
Name=FDCAN
Version=STM32N6_fdcan1_v1_2

[Parameters]
# имя|подпись|группа|единица|мин|макс|описание
FrameFormat|Frame Format|Basic Parameters||||Specifies the FDCAN frame format.
Mode|Mode|Basic Parameters||||Specifies the FDCAN operating mode.
AutoRetransmission|Auto Retransmission|Basic Parameters||||Enable or disable the automatic retransmission mode.
ClockDivider|Clock Divider|Clock Divider||||Specifies the FDCAN kernel clock divider when the clock calibration is bypassed.
TxDelayCompensation|Tx Delay Compensation|Basic Parameters||||Enable or disable the transmitter delay compensation.
NominalPrescaler|Nominal Prescaler|Bit Timings Parameters||1|512|Specifies the value by which the oscillator frequency is divided for generating the nominal bit time quanta.
NominalSyncJumpWidth|Nominal Sync Jump Width|Basic Parameters||1|128|Specifies the maximum number of time quanta the FDCAN hardware is allowed to lengthen or shorten a bit to perform resynchronization.
NominalTimeSeg1|Nominal Time Seg1|Bit Timings Parameters||2|256|Specifies the number of time quanta in Bit Segment 1.
NominalTimeSeg2|Nominal Time Seg2|Bit Timings Parameters||2|128|Specifies the number of time quanta in Bit Segment 2.
DataPrescaler|Data Prescaler|Basic Parameters||1|32|Specifies the value by which the oscillator frequency is divided for generating the data bit time quanta.
DataSyncJumpWidth|Data Sync Jump Width|Basic Parameters||1|16|Specifies the maximum number of time quanta the FDCAN hardware is allowed to lengthen or shorten a data bit to perform resynchronization.
DataTimeSeg1|Data Time Seg1|Basic Parameters||1|32|Specifies the number of time quanta in Data Bit Segment 1.
DataTimeSeg2|Data Time Seg2|Basic Parameters||1|16|Specifies the number of time quanta in Data Bit Segment 2.
StdFiltersNbr|Std Filters Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|128|Specifies the number of standard Message ID filter.
ExtFiltersNbr|Ext Filters Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|64|Specifies the number of extended Message ID filters.
RxFifo0ElmtsNbr|Rx Fifo0 Elmts Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|64|Specifies the number of Rx FIFO0 Elements.
RxFifo0ElmtSize|Rx Fifo0 Elmt Size|Basic Parameters||||Specifies the Data Field Size in an Rx FIFO0 element.
RxFifo1ElmtsNbr|Rx Fifo1 Elmts Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|64|Specifies the number of Rx FIFO 1 Elements.
RxFifo1ElmtSize|Rx Fifo1 Elmt Size|Basic Parameters||||Specifies the Rx FIFO 1 Data Field Size.
RxBuffersNbr|Rx Buffers Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|64|Specifies the number of Dedicated Rx Buffer elements.
RxBufferSize|Rx Buffer Size|Basic Parameters||||Specifies the Rx Buffer Data Field Size.
TxEventsNbr|Tx Events Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|32|Specifies the number of Tx Event FIFO elements.
TxBuffersNbr|Tx Buffers Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|32|Specifies the number of Dedicated Tx Buffers.
TxFifoQueueElmtsNbr|Tx Fifo Queue Elmts Nbr|Basic Parameters||0|4294967295|Specifies the number of Tx Buffers used for Tx FIFO/Queue.
TxFifoQueueMode|Tx Fifo Queue Mode|Basic Parameters||||Tx FIFO/Queue Mode selection.
TxElmtSize|Tx Elmt Size|Basic Parameters||||Specifies the Tx Element Data Field Size.
